    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T16:36:02Z",
    "body": "The target parent for this draft is the corrected #2951 at `f92e67857`. Its trial merge with `6b790f4dd` conflicts in `crates/post/src/agie/contour.rs`, `crates/post/src/agie/tests.rs` and `docs/user-guide/agie-wire-edm.md`.\n\nThe two versions change how the post prepares the contour. The parent builds a guarded punch setup with checked stock and threading coordinates. This draft extends the earlier preparation code to split an oblique entry face and check corner clearance. Taking either version as a whole would lose required behavior.\n\nOur proposed update keeps the parent's zero-step setup and ports the oblique entry, face-split and corner checks into it. The combined tests must check both the nominal path and the refusal cases. A fresh offline control import must show the oblique path and zero working steps. The earlier four-pass control plot applies to the previous writer.\n\nThe draft remains on its current head for individual review after #2951.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
